{
  "key": "ws-disconnectionnotice",
  "config": {
    "pageSize": "A4",
    "pageMargins": [40, 40, 40, 40],
    "watermark": {
      "text": "DELHI JAL BOARD",
      "color": "#004085",
      "opacity": 0.08,
      "bold": true,
      "italics": false
    },
    "defaultStyle": {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "color": "#333333",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "DELHI JAL BOARD",
        "style": "mainHeader"
      },
      {
        "text": "INFORMATION NOTICE - METER DISCONNECTION",
        "style": "subHeader"
      },
      {
        "canvas": [{ "type": "line", "x1": 0, "y1": 5, "x2": 515, "y2": 5, "lineWidth": 1.5, "lineColor": "#004085" }]
      },
      {
        "text": "Subject: Information Regarding Meter Disconnection",
        "style": "subjectStyle",
        "margin": [0, 15, 0, 8]
      },
      {
        "text": "Dear Consumer,",
        "bold": true,
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "text": "This is to inform you that the following meter disconnection has been initiated as per the records of Delhi Jal Board.",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 12]
      },
      {
        "text": "Disconnection Details",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "table": {
          "widths": ["40%", "60%"],
          "body": [
            [{ "text": "KNO / Connection No.:", "bold": true }, "{{kno}}"],
            [{ "text": "Application No.:", "bold": true }, "{{applicationNo}}"],
            [{ "text": "Consumer Name:", "bold": true }, "{{consumerName}}"],
            [{ "text": "Address:", "bold": true }, "{{consumerAddress}}"],
            [{ "text": "Zone:", "bold": true }, "{{zone}}"],
            [{ "text": "ZRO Office:", "bold": true }, "{{zro}}"],
            [{ "text": "Disconnection Date:", "bold": true }, "{{disconnectionDate}}"],
            [{ "text": "Reason for Disconnection:", "bold": true }, "{{disconnectionReason}}"]
          ]
        },
        "layout": "lightHorizontalLines",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "Details of Licensed Plumber",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "text": "The meter disconnection is to be carried out through the following Delhi Jal Board licensed plumber:",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "table": {
          "widths": ["40%", "60%"],
          "body": [
            [{ "text": "Plumber Name:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberName}}"],
            [{ "text": "Plumber Company Name:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberCompany}}"],
            [{ "text": "Mobile Number:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberMobile}}"],
            [{ "text": "Licence / Registration No.:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberLicense}}"]
          ]
        },
        "layout": "lightHorizontalLines",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "text": "The consumer is requested to coordinate with the above-mentioned licensed plumber for the meter disconnection.",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "Important Instructions for the Consumer",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "text": "The consumer is requested to ensure the following:",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "ol": [
          "Photograph Before Disconnection:\nPlease ensure that a clear photograph of the meter and its existing condition is taken before the meter is disconnected.",
          "Photograph After Disconnection:\nPlease ensure that a clear photograph of the meter and the disconnected connection is taken after the meter has been disconnected.",
          "The photographs should clearly capture the meter, meter reading, meter number and surrounding connection/installation, wherever applicable.",
          "The consumer is advised to keep the photographs for their records as proof of the condition of the meter before and after disconnection.",
          "The consumer should verify the identity of the licensed plumber before allowing the disconnection activity to be carried out."
        ],
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "For any clarification regarding the disconnection, the consumer may contact the concerned Delhi Jal Board office.",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "Regards,\nDelhi Jal Board",
        "bold": true,
        "margin": [0, 10, 0, 0]
      }
    ],
    "styles": {
      "mainHeader": {
        "fontSize": 16,
        "bold": true,
        "alignment": "center",
        "color": "#004085"
      },
      "subHeader": {
        "fontSize": 12,
        "bold": true,
        "alignment": "center",
        "margin": [0, 4, 0, 8]
      },
      "subjectStyle": {
        "fontSize": 11,
        "bold": true,
        "color": "#004085"
      },
      "sectionHeader": {
        "fontSize": 11,
        "bold": true,
        "color": "#004085",
        "margin": [0, 10, 0, 6]
      }
    }
  }
}

